        "description": "Retrieve one page of sites for one supplier. Optional narrowing through a caller-authored framework-v4 rowmatch filter; default selects all child IDs. Preserve count, limit, offset and hasMore. Empty items is valid; errors are not empty results. Continue at offset + count while hasMore is true.",
        "operationId": "getall_suppliers-sites",
        "operationType": "GET",
        "resourcePath": "/fscmRestApi/resources/11.13.18.05/suppliers/{suppliers_Id}/child/sites?onlyData=true&q={filter}&orderBy=SupplierSiteId:asc&limit={limit}&offset={offset}",
